<title>ITALY: Gross yield 7.01 pct,price 99.10 at Italy CCT sale.</title>
<headline>Gross yield 7.01 pct,price 99.10 at Italy CCT sale.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for a first tranche of 2.0 trillion lire of seven-year Italian Treasury floating rate certificates (CCTs) paying a first coupon of 3.55 percent.</p>
<p>		   March 1, 2004 CCT	    Pvs</p>
<p>    Net Yield	   6.12 pct		6.35 pct</p>
<p>    Gross yield	 7.01 pct		7.27 pct</p>
<p>    Assigned price   99.10		   99.65</p>
<p>    Total bids	  6.786 trln lire</p>
<p>    Assigned	    2.000 trln lire</p>
<p>Note - Data are not directly comparable because previous CCT auction on February 27 was of a seventh tranche of 3.45 percent, January 1 2004 CCTs.</p>
</text>
